1
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:19,720
(Jung Yong Hwa)

2
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:22,360
(Hong Seung Hee)

3
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:26,260
(Lee Yi Kyung)

4
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:29,230
(Park Yu Na)

5
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:44,250
(Oh! My Guard)

6
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:45,250
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

7
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:46,990
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

8
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:50,020
So pull yourself together and listen.

9
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:52,220
You are not Cha Hong Du.

10
00:01:00,330 --> 00:01:03,030
Your name and the world you believe in.

11
00:01:05,340 --> 00:01:06,470
None of it is real.

12
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:14,480
No, what on earth are you...

13
00:01:20,390 --> 00:01:22,890
- What is wrong? - My head hurts so much.

14
00:01:24,690 --> 00:01:27,060
Tell me again so I can understand. What is not real?

15
00:01:28,660 --> 00:01:30,560
Some patients forget reality and...

16
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:33,570
hope to live in a world of their own making.

17
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:35,900
If you are like Mr. Choi...

18
00:01:37,970 --> 00:01:39,440
I am asking what you mean by that.

19
00:01:44,310 --> 00:01:45,310
Hong Du.

20
00:01:45,580 --> 00:01:46,780
Tae Bong.

21
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:54,990
It is still cold at night. Hey, call him again.

22
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:56,320
Yes, okay.

23
00:01:57,920 --> 00:02:01,130
He is not in the parking lot either. This guy is really driving me crazy.

24
00:02:02,890 --> 00:02:04,130
Na Ri, where are you...

25
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:07,130
What? Are you all together right now?

26
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:10,700
Okay, I will be right in. Tell him to stop calling me.

27
00:02:10,770 --> 00:02:11,770
Seriously.

28
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:14,070
I guess everyone is worried about us.

29
00:02:14,810 --> 00:02:15,970
Anyway, it is a relief.

30
00:02:16,510 --> 00:02:18,210
I was worried you two might have gotten lost.

31
00:02:19,510 --> 00:02:20,580
Have you not heard?

32
00:02:21,380 --> 00:02:22,680
The human navigation system?

33
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:25,980
You have heard of it, right? Um Navigation.

34
00:02:27,350 --> 00:02:28,690
But why did you two leave your drinks...

35
00:02:28,820 --> 00:02:29,820
and come out here?

36
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:32,960
To look for a ring.

37
00:02:34,690 --> 00:02:35,690
A ring?

38
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,630
What?

39
00:02:37,630 --> 00:02:40,470
Oh, yes. I left Um Tae Bong's ring behind.

40
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:45,000
Be careful. You almost fell.

41
00:02:45,770 --> 00:02:48,670
- You should be careful yourself. - Hong Du, it is dangerous,

42
00:02:48,740 --> 00:02:51,840
so walk on the inside. It is dark, so stay close to me.

43
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:53,440
Okay.

44
00:03:00,490 --> 00:03:02,720
Tae Bong, hurry up. I am scared.

45
00:03:03,150 --> 00:03:04,220
Okay.

46
00:03:30,950 --> 00:03:33,550
Your name and the world you believe in.

47
00:03:35,990 --> 00:03:37,090
None of it is real.

48
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:39,160
What was that?

49
00:03:40,190 --> 00:03:41,630
What did he mean earlier?

50
00:03:46,730 --> 00:03:47,800
Mr. Han?

51
00:04:03,180 --> 00:04:06,250
But the mood earlier was a bit...

52
00:04:07,290 --> 00:04:09,450
Oh, it is nothing.

53
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:17,360
- But Mr. Han. - Yes?

54
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:19,160
Why are you so nice to me?

55
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:22,200
I do not know either.

56
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,680
It is hot.

57
00:04:51,930 --> 00:04:52,930
Tae Bong, are you asleep?

58
00:04:53,030 --> 00:04:54,970
(Tae Bong, are you asleep?)

59
00:04:55,130 --> 00:04:57,870
I have been asleep for a while. You are dead if you wake me up.

60
00:05:09,210 --> 00:05:10,520
If you disappear without saying anything again,

61
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:11,720
you are really going to get hit.

62
00:05:11,780 --> 00:05:13,280
(Disappear again, and you get hit.)

63
00:05:17,090 --> 00:05:18,160
Darn it.

64
00:05:28,100 --> 00:05:29,970
- What is it? - Nothing.

65
00:05:30,770 --> 00:05:32,400
Su Dong told me to check your schedule...

66
00:05:32,470 --> 00:05:33,670
for tomorrow afternoon.

67
00:05:33,810 --> 00:05:36,010
I am going to sleep like a log until the charity party.

68
00:05:36,610 --> 00:05:37,780
So you are dead if you wake me up.

69
00:05:39,580 --> 00:05:40,580
Are you sulking again?

70
00:05:42,850 --> 00:05:43,950
Thanks for earlier.

71
00:05:45,050 --> 00:05:46,620
For shining the flashlight behind me.

72
00:05:49,690 --> 00:05:50,690
You saw that?

73
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:52,360
Of course I did.

74
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:56,060
You were just like my dad. Worried that I might fall,

75
00:05:56,130 --> 00:05:59,300
he always shined a flashlight behind me when I was young.

76
00:06:00,100 --> 00:06:01,130
He hugged me a lot, too.

77
00:06:05,140 --> 00:06:06,770
Are you sure...

78
00:06:07,740 --> 00:06:08,740
that it is your memory?

79
00:06:10,340 --> 00:06:12,780
Of course I am sure. What kind of question is that?

80
00:06:13,180 --> 00:06:14,210
What about other memories?

81
00:06:15,210 --> 00:06:17,620
Do you not remember anything else from your childhood?

82
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:29,360
Gosh, this keeps happening lately.

83
00:06:29,430 --> 00:06:30,830
Whenever I try to remember something,

84
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,700
it feels like my head is going to split open...

85
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:35,670
Is it an aftereffect of the accident?

86
00:06:42,070 --> 00:06:43,740
More importantly...

87
00:06:44,510 --> 00:06:47,310
About what you said at the beach earlier.

88
00:06:48,180 --> 00:06:50,480
You said my name and the world I believe in...

89
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:51,750
are all fake.

90
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:55,490
- What did you mean by that? - That?

91
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:58,560
That...

92
00:06:58,990 --> 00:07:00,930
I was just saying that.

93
00:07:02,230 --> 00:07:03,230
Just saying it?

94
00:07:04,100 --> 00:07:05,930
You have been talking nonsense lately.

95
00:07:06,460 --> 00:07:07,970
Dreaming about me dying and all.

96
00:07:09,170 --> 00:07:12,170
And lying in a hospital for three years,

97
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,700
then suddenly appearing out of nowhere.

98
00:07:14,110 --> 00:07:15,410
It all seems like a lie.

99
00:07:15,470 --> 00:07:18,240
Your world, the dreams you have, all of it.

100
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:28,690
Is that really it?

101
00:07:31,820 --> 00:07:32,820
Seriously?

102
00:07:33,830 --> 00:07:35,590
Do you think I am hiding something from you?

103
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:38,330
No, not necessarily that.

104
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:40,260
You just seemed a bit strange earlier.

105
00:07:40,670 --> 00:07:41,770
I am always strange.

106
00:07:42,370 --> 00:07:45,870
Gosh, what is that? I was serious for nothing.

107
00:07:46,470 --> 00:07:47,470
Sleep well.

108
00:07:48,670 --> 00:07:49,710
Thanks for earlier.

109
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:54,850
For comforting me.

110
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:57,950
I forgive your sins.

111
00:07:58,550 --> 00:08:01,920
Do not feel sorry for kiddo anymore.

112
00:08:01,990 --> 00:08:03,790
Because I forgave you on her behalf.

113
00:08:05,420 --> 00:08:07,120
But what I need...

114
00:08:08,230 --> 00:08:09,330
is not comfort...

115
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,000
Treatment, I guess.

116
00:08:15,100 --> 00:08:16,100
Go.

117
00:08:31,350 --> 00:08:33,550
How can I treat him?

118
00:08:34,790 --> 00:08:36,420
Are you sure...

119
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,320
that it is your memory?

120
00:08:41,130 --> 00:08:43,160
But why did he say that?

121
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:57,210
In that drama,

122
00:08:57,980 --> 00:09:00,010
there was no childhood backstory.

123
00:09:03,980 --> 00:09:04,980
Could it be?

124
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,870
Did you not come out for some fresh air?

125
00:09:22,930 --> 00:09:23,940
Song Na Ri.

126
00:09:41,190 --> 00:09:42,190
Well...

127
00:09:43,990 --> 00:09:45,390
How did you recognise me?

128
00:09:45,660 --> 00:09:46,820
People rarely recognise me barefaced.

129
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,630
You look exactly the same with or without makeup.

130
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:51,430
I think you can skip the makeup starting tomorrow.

131
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:52,560
You hear that a lot, right?

132
00:09:52,630 --> 00:09:54,130
No, that is the first time I have heard that!

133
00:09:55,470 --> 00:09:56,470
Unbelievable.

134
00:10:03,770 --> 00:10:05,140
Well, anyway...

135
00:10:05,940 --> 00:10:06,940
You cannot sleep?

136
00:10:07,950 --> 00:10:10,480
- You too, Na Ri? - I asked you first.

137
00:10:10,820 --> 00:10:12,280
You can just answer first.

138
00:10:12,950 --> 00:10:14,950
We really do not get along.

139
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:20,760
But...

140
00:10:22,090 --> 00:10:23,130
For some reason...

141
00:10:23,690 --> 00:10:25,500
do you not feel like we are falling behind?

142
00:10:27,430 --> 00:10:29,170
I am still going to keep trying, though.

143
00:10:32,370 --> 00:10:33,440
I guess you still do not get it.

144
00:10:36,370 --> 00:10:37,940
Do you think I am an idiot?

145
00:10:39,180 --> 00:10:40,180
You know what?

146
00:10:40,950 --> 00:10:42,910
I really do not like you.

147
00:10:47,280 --> 00:10:49,950
This is ridiculous. He really thinks I am an idiot.

148
00:10:52,590 --> 00:10:53,590
Does she actually know?

149
00:11:06,700 --> 00:11:07,840
Song Na Ri!

150
00:11:08,770 --> 00:11:09,810
Good night!

151
00:11:10,270 --> 00:11:11,280
What the heck!

152
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,710
The shop is closed this weekend,

153
00:11:13,780 --> 00:11:15,050
so I am going to tag along with Tae Bong.

154
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:17,350
With the commercial shoot and the BK Party event,

155
00:11:17,420 --> 00:11:18,580
it will take 2 days and 1 night.

156
00:11:18,650 --> 00:11:19,950
On a 2-day-1-night trip.

157
00:11:20,050 --> 00:11:22,320
I hope you all take some time to heal like me.

158
00:11:25,420 --> 00:11:28,930
(Jin Ah)

159
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:35,200
Jin Ah.

160
00:11:36,070 --> 00:11:39,270
You said you got invited to the BK Party, right?

161
00:12:11,170 --> 00:12:13,640
Gosh. You scared me.

162
00:12:16,810 --> 00:12:17,810
What is it?

163
00:12:18,310 --> 00:12:19,510
Is this a zombie wake-up call?

164
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:22,610
What? What is it?

165
00:12:23,210 --> 00:12:25,750
- Did I... - You died.

166
00:12:26,020 --> 00:12:27,790
You keep dying in my dreams.

167
00:12:30,620 --> 00:12:34,020
Well, they say dreams reflect your true feelings.

168
00:12:34,460 --> 00:12:37,030
Do you want to kill me? Did you kill me?

169
00:12:38,130 --> 00:12:39,460
It did not end with a gun.

170
00:12:40,430 --> 00:12:41,500
Then who shot me?

171
00:12:42,870 --> 00:12:43,870
Where are you going?

172
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:46,340
To get breakfast. If I do not go now, I will be late.

173
00:12:46,540 --> 00:12:47,770
I need to eat at least three plates.

174
00:12:48,070 --> 00:12:50,980
You just said I died. How can you eat at a time like this?

175
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:53,610
Should you not at least fast to mourn my death?

176
00:12:56,350 --> 00:12:59,820
Is she worried I might die like in the drama?

177
00:13:00,850 --> 00:13:03,550
Is that why she keeps having those dreams...

178
00:13:04,490 --> 00:13:05,490
What is it?

179
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:07,120
Did Cha Hong Du dream about you dying?

180
00:13:07,290 --> 00:13:08,530
Like in your drama?

181
00:13:09,660 --> 00:13:10,830
Oh, seriously.

182
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,360
What dream?

183
00:13:13,030 --> 00:13:14,270
Where are you going?

184
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:16,730
- I am going to get breakfast. - Unbelievable.

185
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:19,340
Are they all possessed by ghosts that died from missing breakfast?

186
00:13:20,070 --> 00:13:21,070
Where is Dong Seok?

187
00:13:21,270 --> 00:13:22,940
He rushed back to Seoul this morning.

188
00:13:23,740 --> 00:13:24,880
- Seoul? - Yes.

189
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:26,680
- Why? - I do not know.

190
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:30,850
I begged a senior officer to get this for me.

191
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:33,220
Could it be the same guy from the parking lot?

192
00:13:35,790 --> 00:13:37,050
Tae Bong will know when he sees it.

193
00:13:45,030 --> 00:13:46,460
They confirmed the handwriting matches.

194
00:13:46,900 --> 00:13:49,100
But are you really not going to request an official investigation?

195
00:13:51,570 --> 00:13:56,040
This letter dates back two months.

196
00:13:56,910 --> 00:13:58,040
Darn it.

197
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:06,980
Yes, CEO Park, I am currently in front of Tae Bong's house...

198
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:09,420
and the security camera on the wall...

199
00:14:25,900 --> 00:14:27,140
I will call you right back.

200
00:14:40,350 --> 00:14:41,520
What are you doing, you punk?

201
00:14:42,790 --> 00:14:44,290
Who are you to snoop around someone else's house?

202
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,490
Why are you doing this? I was just passing by...

203
00:14:46,560 --> 00:14:47,560
Hold on.

204
00:14:47,660 --> 00:14:49,290
You snooped around without knowing whose house it is?

205
00:14:50,460 --> 00:14:52,900
I know. I know it is Um Tae Bong's house.

206
00:14:53,330 --> 00:14:54,330
Was it you?

207
00:14:54,670 --> 00:14:56,070
The one who has been hanging around Tae Bong...

208
00:14:56,530 --> 00:15:00,270
Yes, that is correct. Please check my pocket.

209
00:15:00,470 --> 00:15:01,470
Here.

210
00:15:04,610 --> 00:15:05,740
(Our Tree Foundation)

211
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:08,050
(Our Tree Foundation)

212
00:15:08,810 --> 00:15:13,020
Well, earlier this year, Um Tae Bong made a donation to our organisation,

213
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:16,150
so I came to thank him. It is the truth.

214
00:15:24,500 --> 00:15:25,500
I am sorry.

215
00:15:26,160 --> 00:15:27,970
I misunderstood the situation.

216
00:15:28,830 --> 00:15:30,270
I should have contacted you before coming...

217
00:15:30,830 --> 00:15:31,840
Here.

218
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:39,040
- I will come back next time. - Yes, I am sorry.

219
00:15:40,340 --> 00:15:41,350
I am sorry.

220
00:15:55,790 --> 00:15:56,830
Yes, CEO Park.

221
00:15:58,760 --> 00:16:00,230
No, I just had a little misunderstanding.

222
00:16:02,930 --> 00:16:05,640
And about Hong Du guarding Tae Bong,

223
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:08,040
everyone has found out about it.

224
00:16:20,450 --> 00:16:22,550
Are you okay? Is everything fine?

225
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:23,990
What about the man who just came in?

226
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:25,720
(Cleaning Supplies)

227
00:16:44,780 --> 00:16:46,340
That girl was a bodyguard?

228
00:16:48,980 --> 00:16:50,350
This is going to be fun.

229
00:16:55,220 --> 00:16:58,060
(Our Tree Foundation)

230
00:17:16,570 --> 00:17:18,180
(Our Tree Foundation)

231
00:17:18,580 --> 00:17:20,640
- We're from Our Tree Foundation. - Excuse me.

232
00:17:21,750 --> 00:17:22,750
Excuse me.

233
00:17:22,810 --> 00:17:24,110
Hello, we are from Our Tree Foundation.

234
00:17:29,020 --> 00:17:30,120
Excuse me.

235
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:47,700
Did you eat a lot, even dessert?

236
00:17:48,440 --> 00:17:51,280
I would be full if I ate that too. If I am full, I will get sleepy,

237
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:52,510
and if I am sleepy, I will sleep.

238
00:17:52,580 --> 00:17:54,650
If I sleep, I will have that dream again.

239
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:56,610
Are you scared...

240
00:17:57,980 --> 00:17:59,980
- that I might die? - Do you think I would be excited?

241
00:18:03,250 --> 00:18:04,320
Why?

242
00:18:04,690 --> 00:18:05,720
In that dream,

243
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:09,630
- did you cry? - Do you think I laughed?

244
00:18:10,630 --> 00:18:12,630
Well, do not worry. They say dreams are the opposite of reality.

245
00:18:12,760 --> 00:18:15,830
You are going to live until you are old and gray.

246
00:18:17,370 --> 00:18:18,370
I am leaving.

247
00:18:21,270 --> 00:18:22,870
Am I worried about that right now?

248
00:18:23,670 --> 00:18:25,880
Anyway, this is all because of the writer.

249
00:18:26,010 --> 00:18:27,340
Just because I refused the kiss scene,

250
00:18:27,410 --> 00:18:28,680
she kills off the main character at the end?

251
00:18:28,750 --> 00:18:29,750
And with a gun?

252
00:18:30,310 --> 00:18:33,320
Since when does Korea even allow firearms?

253
00:18:41,490 --> 00:18:44,530
We have time before the event, right?

254
00:18:59,310 --> 00:19:00,780
But why a survival game all of a sudden?

255
00:19:01,110 --> 00:19:02,810
Just bored.

256
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:04,350
Since we are wearing the same outfit,

257
00:19:04,410 --> 00:19:06,380
I guess we have no choice but to team up.

258
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:07,920
The rules are simple.

259
00:19:07,990 --> 00:19:09,250
Minimum shooting distance is 1m.

260
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:11,190
No headshots and no hitting below the belt.

261
00:19:11,290 --> 00:19:14,060
- Got it? - Okay, 1 shot, 1 kill.

262
00:19:14,560 --> 00:19:18,960
All right, we start in five seconds. Ready?

263
00:19:20,130 --> 00:19:21,130
Five.

264
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:23,200
Four.

265
00:19:24,230 --> 00:19:25,240
Three!

266
00:19:25,940 --> 00:19:28,370
- What is he... - So cool.

267
00:19:28,840 --> 00:19:29,910
Hong Du, good luck.

268
00:19:30,370 --> 00:19:31,380
Good luck.

269
00:20:05,480 --> 00:20:07,110
Hong Du, you take that side. I will take this side.

270
00:20:07,180 --> 00:20:08,180
Go.

271
00:20:34,570 --> 00:20:35,570
Where are they?

272
00:20:57,760 --> 00:20:58,760
Cha Hong Du?

273
00:21:01,260 --> 00:21:02,270
Cha Hong Du.

274
00:21:04,700 --> 00:21:05,770
Han Jung Woo.

275
00:21:41,270 --> 00:21:42,310
Han Jung Woo.

276
00:21:56,250 --> 00:21:59,490
Get up. Han Jung Woo.

277
00:22:10,570 --> 00:22:11,600
Cha Hong Du.

278
00:22:12,700 --> 00:22:13,700
Watch closely.

279
00:22:15,610 --> 00:22:16,970
I am going to change...

280
00:22:17,970 --> 00:22:19,680
the last scene you remember.

281
00:22:35,630 --> 00:22:36,660
So...

282
00:22:40,100 --> 00:22:41,230
From now on...

283
00:22:45,570 --> 00:22:47,640
- No more bad dreams... - Um Tae Bong.

284
00:23:07,420 --> 00:23:09,790
I will kill you.

285
00:23:10,860 --> 00:23:13,100
Darn it. You think this is funny?

286
00:23:15,570 --> 00:23:17,870
If you have any last words, say them now.

287
00:23:18,870 --> 00:23:19,870
Now...

288
00:23:21,400 --> 00:23:22,410
Seriously...

289
00:23:24,070 --> 00:23:25,980
From now on,

290
00:23:26,710 --> 00:23:28,110
no more bad dreams.

291
00:23:29,550 --> 00:23:30,550
Cha Hong Du.

292
00:23:37,920 --> 00:23:39,420
Tae Bong!

293
00:23:43,230 --> 00:23:46,360
Tae Bong, if you die like this, what am I supposed to do?

294
00:23:46,430 --> 00:23:49,700
- Tae Bong, come back to life! - Hey.

295
00:23:50,270 --> 00:23:51,270
What?

296
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:53,240
That is not how it goes.

297
00:23:53,570 --> 00:23:54,910
Fine, I will avenge you.

298
00:23:55,510 --> 00:23:57,570
You are all dead!

299
00:24:00,610 --> 00:24:01,680
Stop it, darn it.

300
00:24:05,450 --> 00:24:06,550
Na Ri wins.

301
00:24:07,580 --> 00:24:10,090
(Na Ri Win)

302
00:24:14,520 --> 00:24:15,560
What the?

303
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:27,500
How much would it take?

304
00:24:28,910 --> 00:24:29,910
For what?

305
00:24:34,810 --> 00:24:35,880
Your price.

306
00:24:38,080 --> 00:24:39,350
I want to recruit you.

307
00:24:40,520 --> 00:24:41,550
Three thousand dollars a month.

308
00:24:44,620 --> 00:24:45,620
You do like money.

309
00:24:46,390 --> 00:24:47,390
Five thousand dollars a month?

310
00:24:54,800 --> 00:24:55,800
How about...

311
00:24:56,030 --> 00:24:57,300
seven thousand?

312
00:25:00,340 --> 00:25:03,270
Darn it, my dream of owning a building gets even further away.

313
00:25:04,610 --> 00:25:06,010
Talking to yourself again?

314
00:25:07,040 --> 00:25:09,350
Anyway, think about being my bodyguard.

315
00:25:09,880 --> 00:25:11,680
Honestly, I am in more danger than he is.

316
00:25:11,750 --> 00:25:12,750
You saw it last time.

317
00:25:12,820 --> 00:25:14,220
I mean, the older male fans at my concerts...

318
00:25:14,280 --> 00:25:17,590
- can get pretty wild. - No, don't.

319
00:25:18,620 --> 00:25:20,320
Even for fans, that is crossing the line.

320
00:25:23,290 --> 00:25:24,560
What you need is...

321
00:25:24,960 --> 00:25:26,830
someone to tell you this, not a bodyguard.

322
00:25:34,070 --> 00:25:35,070
She is so cool.

323
00:25:36,370 --> 00:25:37,370
Thank you.

324
00:25:38,140 --> 00:25:40,280
I am in Building A, and you are in Building B.

325
00:25:40,840 --> 00:25:43,480
- Let us unpack and meet up later. - Yes, okay.

326
00:25:52,090 --> 00:25:55,130
I am closer to you right now than you might think.

327
00:26:13,510 --> 00:26:14,980
Gosh, my nose is running.

328
00:26:18,210 --> 00:26:20,220
Still as rude as ever, seriously.

329
00:26:24,250 --> 00:26:26,260
Oh, it is the pretty lady.

330
00:26:28,830 --> 00:26:29,930
Hello.

331
00:26:30,190 --> 00:26:31,360
Oh, Hong Du.

332
00:26:45,740 --> 00:26:48,910
I am closer to you right now than you might think.

333
00:26:50,050 --> 00:26:51,180
Did she come here?

334
00:26:58,620 --> 00:27:02,130
- Are you here for the party too? - Yes, with an older female friend.

335
00:27:05,430 --> 00:27:07,330
Actually, there is something I want to check.

336
00:27:11,070 --> 00:27:12,070
What is going on?

337
00:27:14,400 --> 00:27:17,110
Excuse me. The elevator has stopped.

338
00:27:17,170 --> 00:27:19,010
I am so sorry, we will fix it as soon as...

339
00:27:19,180 --> 00:27:20,240
Excuse me, how long will it take?

340
00:27:20,310 --> 00:27:21,910
We will have it fixed within 20 minutes.

341
00:27:21,980 --> 00:27:22,980
Twenty minutes?

342
00:27:25,180 --> 00:27:26,520
My legs hurt.

343
00:27:27,880 --> 00:27:29,990
Let us sit and wait.

344
00:27:38,500 --> 00:27:40,400
They say it is bad for women to sit on cold floors.

345
00:27:41,460 --> 00:27:43,870
Oh, right.

346
00:27:46,570 --> 00:27:47,900
- Thank you. - You are welcome.

347
00:27:59,880 --> 00:28:03,420
Hyun Joo is like a splinter stuck under my fingernail.

348
00:28:05,890 --> 00:28:07,060
Must be nice to be a splinter.

349
00:28:08,190 --> 00:28:10,390
- What? - What?

350
00:28:13,860 --> 00:28:17,030
Well, if a man...

351
00:28:17,270 --> 00:28:20,400
calls a woman a splinter stuck under his fingernail,

352
00:28:20,800 --> 00:28:22,140
that means he really likes her, right?

353
00:28:23,340 --> 00:28:24,410
A man...

354
00:28:25,580 --> 00:28:26,740
said that about a woman?

355
00:28:27,540 --> 00:28:28,550
Yes.

356
00:28:28,850 --> 00:28:30,650
I thought about it after hearing that.

357
00:28:31,310 --> 00:28:34,650
That man must really like that splinter.

358
00:28:36,090 --> 00:28:37,090
I doubt it.

359
00:28:39,860 --> 00:28:42,490
The splinter probably fell out a long time ago,

360
00:28:42,960 --> 00:28:44,690
but it has been so long that he is the only one...

361
00:28:44,830 --> 00:28:45,830
who does not realise it.

362
00:28:46,500 --> 00:28:47,660
That is how it sounds to me.

363
00:28:49,970 --> 00:28:51,800
That is just how time spent together works.

364
00:28:52,640 --> 00:28:53,900
It makes people very confused.

365
00:28:55,340 --> 00:28:58,170
I know because I have been through that kind of experience myself.

366
00:28:59,380 --> 00:29:00,380
Experience?

367
00:29:00,680 --> 00:29:01,680
Yes.

368
00:29:02,750 --> 00:29:04,350
I am finally more certain now...

369
00:29:05,580 --> 00:29:06,580
about how I feel.

370
00:29:12,260 --> 00:29:15,430
Then what if a man is always...

371
00:29:15,490 --> 00:29:17,630
getting mad and yelling at a woman?

372
00:29:17,960 --> 00:29:20,460
- He likes her. - What? No.

373
00:29:21,060 --> 00:29:22,070
I bet he does.

374
00:29:23,370 --> 00:29:24,770
I know a guy like that too.

375
00:29:24,970 --> 00:29:26,470
He nags me more than a boyfriend would.

376
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:31,340
I mean, even though I am older, he always just calls me Hyun Joo.

377
00:29:32,540 --> 00:29:33,880
But he has not been doing that lately.

378
00:29:38,180 --> 00:29:39,320
It is frustrating.

379
00:29:40,520 --> 00:29:41,850
Hold on a second.

380
00:29:42,550 --> 00:29:45,190
Whenever I got in a car, I could not breathe,

381
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:48,360
but ever since I got this, I have been able to ride in them.

382
00:29:48,790 --> 00:29:50,330
It is a super effective motion sickness patch.

383
00:29:50,860 --> 00:29:53,860
If you take this, you will be able to endure it.

384
00:29:54,860 --> 00:29:55,870
This?

385
00:29:57,530 --> 00:29:58,540
What is it?

386
00:30:03,310 --> 00:30:06,710
Tears are welling up so I lift my head

387
00:30:07,110 --> 00:30:10,450
And smile a little more so they do not fall

388
00:30:10,810 --> 00:30:14,020
Why are you doing this to me? What are you saying?

389
00:30:14,350 --> 00:30:17,850
All the words you said today up to the sky

390
00:30:18,220 --> 00:30:21,760
The words I could never say

391
00:30:38,540 --> 00:30:39,810
Secretary Kim, what brings you here?

392
00:30:42,910 --> 00:30:43,910
What is it?

393
00:30:44,180 --> 00:30:47,680
The chairman will also be attending the VVIP private party.

394
00:30:59,830 --> 00:31:01,360
Doctor,

395
00:31:01,800 --> 00:31:03,800
you are going through a lot of trouble because of me.

396
00:31:04,400 --> 00:31:05,800
You are in good condition today.

397
00:31:07,940 --> 00:31:10,170
Um Tae Bong must have taken good care of you.

398
00:31:14,340 --> 00:31:16,610
I wonder how many more days like this I will have...

399
00:31:17,680 --> 00:31:18,920
I feel like I am just...

400
00:31:19,720 --> 00:31:21,550
making everyone else suffer for nothing.

401
00:31:22,750 --> 00:31:26,120
Now, I think it would be best to consider a specialised facility...

402
00:31:26,320 --> 00:31:28,390
where he can receive both medication and physical therapy.

403
00:31:28,990 --> 00:31:31,060
Yes, well,

404
00:31:31,360 --> 00:31:33,700
that is something we need to discuss as well.

405
00:31:33,960 --> 00:31:35,600
Excuse me. I have a phone call...

406
00:31:37,170 --> 00:31:38,230
Yes, hello.

407
00:31:38,500 --> 00:31:40,770
Did that person also go to the BK event?

408
00:31:41,540 --> 00:31:44,640
I told you about that before, but why do you ask?

409
00:31:52,020 --> 00:31:55,790
It seems the young lady was indeed staying in that neighbourhood.

410
00:31:56,220 --> 00:31:57,990
It looks like they sneaked the young lady away...

411
00:31:58,090 --> 00:31:59,160
before you arrived, Chairman Oh.

412
00:31:59,720 --> 00:32:00,920
Could the money from selling the shares...

413
00:32:00,990 --> 00:32:02,490
be her escape fund?

414
00:32:02,860 --> 00:32:05,730
But earlier, when we were leaving your house,

415
00:32:05,930 --> 00:32:07,460
Manager Nam Goong was also moving in a hurry...

416
00:32:22,610 --> 00:32:24,350
(Elevator Under Maintenance, Do Not Board)

417
00:32:28,420 --> 00:32:30,250
She is a woman who absolutely cannot stand feeling trapped.

418
00:32:30,790 --> 00:32:31,920
Is there enough air in there?

419
00:32:32,260 --> 00:32:33,820
How many hours are you going to keep her locked up?

420
00:32:33,890 --> 00:32:35,590
It has only been ten minutes.

421
00:32:35,890 --> 00:32:37,090
Please hurry up.

422
00:32:43,600 --> 00:32:44,600
Tae Bong.

423
00:32:45,540 --> 00:32:46,540
Are you two okay?

424
00:32:47,170 --> 00:32:48,240
What kind of person are you?

425
00:32:48,740 --> 00:32:50,940
You are really driving me crazy...

426
00:32:52,210 --> 00:32:53,210
What did you do in there?

427
00:32:53,280 --> 00:32:55,140
What did you touch to make the elevator stop?

428
00:32:55,210 --> 00:32:58,680
Gosh. Now it is my fault that the elevator broke down?

429
00:33:00,580 --> 00:33:01,850
What are you staring at?

430
00:33:04,150 --> 00:33:05,290
Hong Du, you must have been so scared.

431
00:33:05,360 --> 00:33:08,060
Regardless, it is our fault. We apologize.

432
00:33:14,900 --> 00:33:15,900
Tae Bong.

433
00:33:17,700 --> 00:33:20,670
Right. Are you okay, too?

434
00:33:21,670 --> 00:33:22,670
Yes.

435
00:33:23,040 --> 00:33:24,040
That is a relief.

436
00:33:24,970 --> 00:33:25,980
This will not do.

437
00:33:26,240 --> 00:33:29,180
You only cause trouble wandering around, so stay in your room later.

438
00:33:29,350 --> 00:33:31,010
What? Then what about the party?

439
00:33:31,080 --> 00:33:33,420
It is a VVIP-only party, do you think they will not have bodyguards?

440
00:33:33,620 --> 00:33:34,620
You do not have to come later.

441
00:33:35,520 --> 00:33:37,590
Fine, I will not go. I would not go even if you begged me.

442
00:33:37,650 --> 00:33:40,520
I did not have anything to wear anyway, happy?

443
00:33:41,260 --> 00:33:42,260
Darn it.

444
00:33:44,830 --> 00:33:45,830
Let us go.

445
00:34:06,050 --> 00:34:07,180
You can go by yourself, right?

446
00:34:08,050 --> 00:34:09,090
What?

447
00:34:09,090 --> 00:34:10,220
I need to get some fresh air.

448
00:34:12,490 --> 00:34:13,490
Okay.

449
00:34:14,090 --> 00:34:15,090
See you later.

450
00:34:25,940 --> 00:34:26,940
Darn it.

451
00:34:30,140 --> 00:34:32,880
Come on, is it my fault the elevator broke down?

452
00:34:32,980 --> 00:34:34,340
He will not even let me go to the party.

453
00:34:34,780 --> 00:34:36,480
And yelling at me in front of her.

454
00:34:37,310 --> 00:34:39,850
He is just a terrible person, seriously.

455
00:34:48,390 --> 00:34:50,790
Hong Du, as a way to comfort a client,

456
00:34:51,190 --> 00:34:53,100
I prepared a small gift.

457
00:35:53,290 --> 00:35:54,790
Hong Du, are you feeling a bit better now?

458
00:35:55,860 --> 00:35:58,230
I went through a lot of trouble to get this bicycle here.

459
00:35:59,560 --> 00:36:00,930
Yes, thanks to you.

460
00:36:02,160 --> 00:36:03,170
Thank you, Jung Woo.

461
00:36:05,840 --> 00:36:09,740
If only a certain someone was even half as nice as you.

462
00:36:12,380 --> 00:36:13,740
But it is really cool.

463
00:36:14,980 --> 00:36:16,510
Protecting someone like that.

464
00:36:18,880 --> 00:36:21,780
I guess I have finally become a useful person now.

465
00:36:23,120 --> 00:36:25,820
Why? Did someone say you are useless, Hong Du?

466
00:36:26,590 --> 00:36:27,590
Excuse me?

467
00:36:29,130 --> 00:36:31,490
No. It is just...

468
00:36:33,530 --> 00:36:35,600
I felt like I was not helping anyone...

469
00:36:36,730 --> 00:36:39,340
and that nobody liked me.

470
00:36:41,640 --> 00:36:42,940
You are the only one who does not know.

471
00:36:43,840 --> 00:36:45,580
Hong Du, to many people,

472
00:36:45,640 --> 00:36:47,080
you are already someone they cannot live without.

473
00:36:48,680 --> 00:36:50,280
- I am? - Yes.

474
00:36:54,380 --> 00:36:57,190
Let us bet on who can...

475
00:36:57,790 --> 00:36:59,120
get over there first.

476
00:36:59,490 --> 00:37:00,720
Where do you mean?

477
00:37:01,560 --> 00:37:02,890
- Until where? - That house over there.

478
00:37:04,360 --> 00:37:06,900
A bet? What kind of bet?

479
00:37:15,170 --> 00:37:17,570
I will catch you, seriously.

480
00:37:19,310 --> 00:37:20,310
I will catch you.

481
00:37:22,080 --> 00:37:23,610
Did you see him get angry earlier?

482
00:37:24,210 --> 00:37:27,750
He has already fallen head over heels for that girl.

483
00:37:27,850 --> 00:37:30,120
The problem is that he is the only one who does not know.

484
00:37:32,050 --> 00:37:34,820
It is only a matter of time before Toxic Na Ri finds out,

485
00:37:34,990 --> 00:37:36,930
and there will be a bloodbath soon.

486
00:37:37,830 --> 00:37:38,930
Probably.

487
00:37:45,330 --> 00:37:46,600
Your sides are going to be a bit tight.

488
00:37:47,100 --> 00:37:48,500
No more carbohydrates from now on.

489
00:37:49,710 --> 00:37:50,710
Understood.

490
00:37:53,080 --> 00:37:54,480
Your face is tanned too.

491
00:37:55,480 --> 00:37:56,950
No more outdoor activities from now on.

492
00:37:57,310 --> 00:37:58,350
Understood.

493
00:37:59,780 --> 00:38:01,380
It only exhausts the people around you.

494
00:38:01,450 --> 00:38:02,750
No more unrequited love from now on.

495
00:38:02,850 --> 00:38:03,850
Fine, I get it...

496
00:38:08,060 --> 00:38:09,060
What?

497
00:38:10,590 --> 00:38:12,930
Actually, I used to be your obsessive fangirl.

498
00:38:13,330 --> 00:38:14,830
Because of your policy of never hiring...

499
00:38:14,900 --> 00:38:17,270
an obsessive fangirl, I could not tell you until now.

500
00:38:19,240 --> 00:38:21,640
That means when it comes to you, there is nothing I do not know.

501
00:38:22,840 --> 00:38:25,270
Unrequited love?

502
00:38:25,270 --> 00:38:26,410
It is not like that.

503
00:38:26,480 --> 00:38:27,680
It really is not.

504
00:38:28,310 --> 00:38:29,850
Whatever you say.

505
00:38:30,810 --> 00:38:31,850
But...

506
00:38:31,950 --> 00:38:33,820
she said it was her first time going to a party,

507
00:38:33,920 --> 00:38:35,550
and she was smiling from ear to ear.

508
00:38:37,850 --> 00:38:38,920
So what do you want me to do?

509
00:38:43,390 --> 00:38:44,860
Could you do me...

510
00:38:46,330 --> 00:38:47,560
a favour?

511
00:38:56,340 --> 00:38:57,340
Hello.

512
00:38:57,510 --> 00:38:59,440
By any chance, did you see that woman?

513
00:38:59,510 --> 00:39:00,780
The ugly one who looks like she has a temper,

514
00:39:00,840 --> 00:39:01,840
- my type... - Oh, right.

515
00:39:04,110 --> 00:39:05,850
You mean the secret bodyguard?

516
00:39:08,550 --> 00:39:09,750
Everyone knows.

517
00:39:09,820 --> 00:39:12,150
I saw her leave with Director Han earlier.

518
00:39:12,220 --> 00:39:14,060
If it is urgent, I can call...

519
00:39:16,830 --> 00:39:18,860
That arrogant jerk.

520
00:39:19,360 --> 00:39:20,360
Darn it.

521
00:39:28,870 --> 00:39:30,370
I actually confirmed it.

522
00:39:30,740 --> 00:39:31,940
What kind of person are you?

523
00:39:32,240 --> 00:39:34,540
You are really driving me crazy...

524
00:39:35,340 --> 00:39:36,350
But...

525
00:39:39,780 --> 00:39:41,280
It was not Song Na Ri.

526
00:39:42,750 --> 00:39:43,950
It was that girl?

527
00:40:15,920 --> 00:40:17,220
Thank you for letting me use your phone.

528
00:40:27,700 --> 00:40:29,130
Back then, with Um Tae Bong,

529
00:40:29,200 --> 00:40:31,000
I received a tip that it was a contract relationship.

530
00:40:33,170 --> 00:40:34,400
And here I thought...

531
00:40:34,840 --> 00:40:36,740
you were going to write a nice article about my marriage,

532
00:40:36,810 --> 00:40:37,870
which is why I came out here.

533
00:40:38,470 --> 00:40:39,480
I am sorry.

534
00:40:39,810 --> 00:40:42,480
But not writing the marriage article and letting this pass quietly...

535
00:40:42,550 --> 00:40:43,750
is actually helping you, is it not?

536
00:40:44,050 --> 00:40:47,050
That gold digger suspicion from last time...

537
00:40:47,720 --> 00:40:49,020
will just cause another uproar, right?

538
00:40:51,790 --> 00:40:53,360
You really will not write the marriage article, right?

539
00:40:53,420 --> 00:40:56,530
Of course not. You know I have always liked you.

540
00:40:58,930 --> 00:41:01,000
The female celebrities who had contract relationships like me...

541
00:41:01,060 --> 00:41:02,460
must have all felt the same.

542
00:41:03,070 --> 00:41:05,630
"Let's really get Um Tae Bong into bed."

543
00:41:06,640 --> 00:41:07,640
But...

544
00:41:08,570 --> 00:41:10,940
he was someone who could not handle any physical affection.

545
00:41:11,410 --> 00:41:14,040
I only tried it once myself.

546
00:41:19,950 --> 00:41:22,150
Thank you for the touching words and comfort.

547
00:41:24,820 --> 00:41:26,920
I left the real gift in front of your door.

548
00:41:28,260 --> 00:41:30,360
Put it on and come to the party later.

