821
00:58:19,470 --> 00:58:20,470
Is that the person?

822
00:58:20,540 --> 00:58:23,370
Yes. The donation is a whopping 300,000 dollars.

823
00:58:26,170 --> 00:58:28,540
Darn it, what do we do about Tae Bong?

824
00:58:30,880 --> 00:58:33,650
The prize changed from a meal to a kiss with Tae Bong.

825
00:58:33,920 --> 00:58:35,720
I heard everything, you punk. Hang up.

826
00:58:36,890 --> 00:58:39,690
Why did he have to say he would do a charity event?

827
00:58:44,460 --> 00:58:46,060
Why is that person here?

828
00:58:46,900 --> 00:58:48,660
Chairman Oh, you are here?

829
00:58:48,730 --> 00:58:50,430
- Yes. Good work. - Chairman Oh?

830
00:58:51,470 --> 00:58:53,870
- Chairman of BK? - The charity donation auction is...

831
00:58:53,970 --> 00:58:54,970
Could it be...

832
00:58:58,770 --> 00:59:00,210
- "I protect my boyfriend's lips." - Hong Du.

833
00:59:00,280 --> 00:59:02,910
Something like that, right?

834
00:59:02,980 --> 00:59:05,810
- Anyway, Song Na Ri has just bid... - Anyway...

835
00:59:05,880 --> 00:59:08,650
- 100,000 dollars. - Hong Du's father...

836
00:59:08,720 --> 00:59:10,550
I was just going to watch and leave...

837
00:59:10,620 --> 00:59:11,790
what should we do about Um Tae Bong?

838
00:59:12,590 --> 00:59:14,960
Hong Du, did you know too?

839
00:59:16,120 --> 00:59:17,190
I see.

840
00:59:18,330 --> 00:59:19,530
What do we do?

841
00:59:19,690 --> 00:59:21,730
Is the era of Um Tae Bong as the romance master...

842
00:59:21,800 --> 00:59:24,000
- coming to an end now? - The bid is 200,000 dollars!

843
00:59:28,240 --> 00:59:29,240
Maybe...

844
00:59:30,240 --> 00:59:31,710
there might be a way.

845
00:59:33,510 --> 00:59:34,610
Is there a way?

846
00:59:35,740 --> 00:59:37,380
- No way... - Maybe.

847
00:59:38,010 --> 00:59:40,050
Surely no one will offer 300,000 dollars...

848
00:59:40,050 --> 00:59:42,520
- at this point, right? - Hong Du,

849
00:59:42,920 --> 00:59:46,220
I will bet Tae Bong's and my future...

850
00:59:46,850 --> 00:59:47,860
(Blank Check)

851
00:59:47,920 --> 00:59:49,190
on you.

852
00:59:49,620 --> 00:59:51,930
A kiss with Um Tae Bong...

853
01:00:21,260 --> 01:00:22,260
Young lady.

854
01:00:24,130 --> 01:00:25,130
Hae Ra?

855
01:00:30,600 --> 01:00:31,600
You?

856
01:00:33,740 --> 01:00:35,470
Blue suits me better.

857
01:00:36,470 --> 01:00:39,270
What, you think I prepared this?

858
01:00:40,780 --> 01:00:42,910
- I did not. - Who said you did?

859
01:00:43,750 --> 01:00:45,410
Still acting tough even now.

860
01:00:50,350 --> 01:00:53,250
It is all over now. In front of these people...

861
01:00:54,660 --> 01:00:55,920
- I clearly... - No.

862
01:01:05,130 --> 01:01:06,570
Hello, Hero.

863
01:01:14,840 --> 01:01:16,310
I wanted to be a hero.

864
01:01:21,180 --> 01:01:24,790
Trust me. I am that kiddo right now.

865
01:01:27,460 --> 01:01:28,460
What?

866
01:01:29,290 --> 01:01:32,190
And this is...

867
01:01:32,990 --> 01:01:35,930
not comfort, but treatment.

868
01:02:04,090 --> 01:02:06,260
(Oh! My Guard)
